===== AGENTS.md =====
# AGENTS.md

Guidance for AI coding agents working in **fixture**.

## Stack

- Language: JavaScript (ESM)
- Module format: ESM
- Package manager: npm
- Bundler: tsup
- Tests: vitest
- Lint/format: eslint-prettier

## Commands

- Lint: `npm run lint`
- Test: `npm test`
- Build: `npm run build`

## Conventions

- Source lives in `src/`. Keep the public API in `src/index.js`.
- Add or update tests for any behavior change.
- Use ESM syntax and JSDoc types where helpful.
- Run `npx changeset` after a user-facing change.
- Do not commit `dist/` or `node_modules/`.

===== CLAUDE.md =====
See [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) for build/test commands and conventions.

===== CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md =====
# Code of Conduct

This project follows the [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/).
By participating, you are expected to uphold this code. Report unacceptable
behavior to the maintainers.

===== CONTRIBUTING.md =====
# Contributing

Thanks for your interest in contributing!

## Development

```sh
npm install
npm test
```

## Pull requests

- Create a branch, make your change, and open a PR against `main`.
- Make sure lint, types and tests pass.
- Run `npx changeset` to describe your change for the changelog.


